From: Jeffy Chen <jeffy.chen@rock-chips.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jan 2025 16:32:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 90/99] drm: Support HW cursor for non-GL renderers

Support hardware cursor on DRM backend without GL/Vulkan renderer by
using DRM dumb buffer exclusively.

Signed-off-by: Jeffy Chen <jeffy.chen@rock-chips.com>
